# Generated QA / build artefacts (2026-07-30). These accumulate hundreds of
# files -- PDF page renders, Playwright traces and screenshots -- and were
# only ever untracked by luck: a single `git add -A` would have swept the
# lot into a commit.
#
# Deliberately NOT ignoring tmp/ or output/ wholesale: the client-facing
# PDFs (output/pdf/) and the scripts that generate them (tmp/pdfs/*.py) are
# tracked on purpose. Only the throwaway render directories are ignored.
test-results/
playwright-report/
.playwright-cli/
output/playwright/
tmp/pdf-review/
tmp/pdfs/render-*/
tmp/pdfs/rendered*/
